2. The following offences may be compounded by the Controller or any immigration officer authorised in that behalf by the Minister in accordance with section 59(1) of the Act:
(a)an offence under section 5(5), 6A(6), 9AA(7)(a), 15(3), 23(2A), 23AA(3) or 29(4) of the Act;
[S 379/2026 wef 20/06/2026]
(b)an offence under regulation 40(1) of the Immigration Regulations (Rg 1) for contravening regulation 12(9), 14(7), 20 or 39 of those Regulations;
(c)an offence under regulation 40(1) of the Immigration Regulations for contravening regulation 19(3)(a), (b) or (c) of those Regulations as in force immediately before 30 May 2025.
